      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: Magic ring, 8 dc. Rounds 2 to 10: standard circle increases (+8 dc per round). By round 10 the base should measure approximately 30 cm across. (88 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fold round"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work 1 dc into the back loop only around. (88 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sides (rounds 12 to 19)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work 1 dc into every stitch in spiral for 8 rounds (approximately 10 cm). Sl st to close. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Secure tails with "
